WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.129 --> 00:00:05.710
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and some serious
Berserker shit went down in the finale.

00:00:05.710 --> 00:00:06.820
I also wanted to give a quick shout out to
Arden Cho who plays Kira on the show.

00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:07.820
Thanks for retweeting me while the episode
was melting everyone’s faces.

00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:10.019
They did a good job of blowing everything
up in our faces and teasing some nice things

00:00:10.019 --> 00:00:11.019
for season 5.

00:00:11.019 --> 00:00:15.010
There’s a whole lot to process so this video
will just be for the finale then I’ll post

00:00:15.010 --> 00:00:16.299
season 5 predictions tomorrow morning.

00:00:16.299 --> 00:00:19.039
Be sure to subscribe to get that if you’re
just finding me for the first time.

00:00:19.039 --> 00:00:22.520
If you guys are wondering what to watch now
that Teen Wolf is gone for a while I’ll

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:24.970
make a few recommendations at the end of the
video.

00:00:24.970 --> 00:00:29.109
But careful for spoilers if you haven’t
seen the episode yet.

00:00:29.109 --> 00:00:31.769
I’m going to do my Top 10 WTF moments and
then my review.

00:00:31.769 --> 00:00:32.769
I’ll wait just a sec...okay, everybody ready.

00:00:32.769 --> 00:00:33.769
Let’s go.

00:00:33.769 --> 00:00:36.050
Number 10 - Berserker Scott Tries to Kill
Kira

00:00:36.050 --> 00:00:40.160
I like how they focused the camera on his
eyes when Kate was explaining he hadn’t

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:41.580
ever killed anyone before.

00:00:41.580 --> 00:00:45.490
Even if he killed someone now though, his
eyes would still glow Alpha Red.

00:00:45.490 --> 00:00:49.540
It’s only when they’re not an alpha that
the colors can be different.

00:00:49.540 --> 00:00:50.830
Unless you’re some other kind of creature.

00:00:50.830 --> 00:00:54.080
Who else is bummed Lydia’s eyes don’t
glow?

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:59.190
I really wanted a deeper dive into the mechanics
of berserkers but they’ll probably add that

00:00:59.190 --> 00:01:01.650
to the DVD commentary if they do one.

00:01:01.650 --> 00:01:05.670
Or someone can ask them at the next convention.

00:01:05.670 --> 00:01:08.359
9 - Derek Gives Liam the Talisman

00:01:08.359 --> 00:01:10.640
What three things cannot stay hidden.

00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:14.799
I loved the Team Sterek moment they shared
while Derek was trying to help Liam.

00:01:14.799 --> 00:01:18.740
I was fun to see him flip during the full
moon but I really wanted to see him hulk out

00:01:18.740 --> 00:01:20.390
in the big final battle.

00:01:20.390 --> 00:01:23.049
I guess that’s something they’re saving
for Season 5.

00:01:23.049 --> 00:01:29.530
He took a bit of a backseat for the rest of
the finale, but had they gotten a 4b this

00:01:29.530 --> 00:01:31.180
year.

00:01:31.180 --> 00:01:34.810
I feel like that’s when he really would
have started to stand out.

00:01:34.810 --> 00:01:38.060
8 - Lydia with a Baseball Bat

00:01:38.060 --> 00:01:40.990
I really hope she joins the softball team
next year.

00:01:40.990 --> 00:01:47.909
That’s not going to happen but there was
this really funny thing going on when I had

00:01:47.909 --> 00:01:51.149
a flashback to the episode where Lydia and
Stiles are at the Lacrosse field and he has

00:01:51.149 --> 00:01:56.149
a baseball bat and she says, we need to find
someone better with a bat.

00:01:56.149 --> 00:01:58.529
Cut to now, she is the better person.

00:01:58.529 --> 00:02:01.560
I think that tells you a lot about where she’s
headed in season 5.

00:02:01.560 --> 00:02:04.389
7 - Peter Asks Malia To Kill

00:02:04.389 --> 00:02:07.000
Peter just wins dad of the year awards all
around.

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:10.180
First he asks her to kill, then he knocks
her out cold across the room.

00:02:10.180 --> 00:02:16.380
I’m sure she’s not going to have any lingering
daddy issues whatsoever, not at all.

00:02:16.380 --> 00:02:22.720
I feel like with the half a season thing going
on, they didn’t get enough time to fully

00:02:22.720 --> 00:02:24.560
explore Malia.

00:02:24.560 --> 00:02:28.320
They hinted from episode to episode that she
was slowly getting used to being a human.

00:02:28.320 --> 00:02:36.510
But then you have the “deer” moments when
you still see the coyote brain poking through.

00:02:36.510 --> 00:02:46.250
That would be a good nickname for the other
pack members to call her when she spaces out.

00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:47.250
Coyote Brain.

00:02:47.250 --> 00:02:49.740
It’s super illegal to just straight up post
clips of the show to youtube, but I would

00:02:49.740 --> 00:02:53.870
really like to see just a compliation of Malia
reacting to things.

00:02:53.870 --> 00:03:00.060
It would be called “Malia Doesn’t Understand”.

00:03:00.060 --> 00:03:05.900
Her clinging to stiles makes a lot more sense
now given what Peter has put her through.

00:03:05.900 --> 00:03:11.760
She’s just going to double down on family
time with the pack.

00:03:11.760 --> 00:03:14.330
6 - We Still Don’t Know What Parrish Is

00:03:14.330 --> 00:03:23.800
I was almost a little upset they didn’t
spend the money to do a full on CG transformation.

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:26.820
They really are saving a lot for Season 5.

00:03:26.820 --> 00:03:31.980
He’s still one of those in between characters
who acts like a normal person, but knows the

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:34.540
whole story about the pack.

00:03:34.540 --> 00:03:38.480
I think Stiles Dad is still going to be the
anchor to the real world and Parrish will

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:40.940
start floating into the world of the pack.

00:03:40.940 --> 00:03:47.000
And the bestiary book at the end was a nice
tease.

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:49.550
5 - Chris Argent Let’s Kate Go

00:03:49.550 --> 00:03:57.810
Remember how I said none of the beautiful
people were going to die.

00:03:57.810 --> 00:04:01.050
There were really two big takeaways I had
from their scene.

00:04:01.050 --> 00:04:06.181
First, Kate is a little nutters but she’s
like the Peter of the Argent Family, she still

00:04:06.181 --> 00:04:08.090
wants to restore their power.

00:04:08.090 --> 00:04:10.210
And Chris is the Derek.

00:04:10.210 --> 00:04:13.810
He’ll never be able to kill his sibling
no matter how terrible he or she gets.

00:04:13.810 --> 00:04:16.340
Plus there’s the whole Desert Wolf thing
going on.

00:04:16.340 --> 00:04:19.000
Does anyone else feel like it might be Kate?

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:24.410
Before I thought kate I assumed it would be
a new character we hadn’t seen yet.

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:25.700
I’m kind of still hoping that.

00:04:25.700 --> 00:04:29.840
I feel like Peter and Kate would have been
too high on themselves to hook up and have

00:04:29.840 --> 00:04:36.810
a baby.

00:04:36.810 --> 00:04:45.000
4 - Kira Learns To Heal Herself

00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:50.270
Couple of awesome Kira Moments here, the healing
factor was another thing they didn’t get

00:04:50.270 --> 00:04:54.310
too mechanical with.

00:04:54.310 --> 00:04:58.500
Jeff Davis said during Wolf Watch that when
they were writing Kira this season they had

00:04:58.500 --> 00:05:02.500
to pick which bits of the Kitsune myth they’d
give to Kira.

00:05:02.500 --> 00:05:07.160
Like they have all kinds of powers but they
didn’t want Kira to be able to do anything.

00:05:07.160 --> 00:05:09.650
They picked healing because it tied the process
back to Scott and the Pack.

00:05:09.650 --> 00:05:13.509
She’s taking on more wolf like qualities,
even if she’ll never be a wolf.

00:05:13.509 --> 00:05:17.320
Groups of people that are really close will
eventually start to absorb each other’s

00:05:17.320 --> 00:05:21.910
personality traits, so of course Kira would
start healing herself like the wolves.

00:05:21.910 --> 00:05:24.200
Did anyone else feel like her mom was giving
her tough love too.

00:05:24.200 --> 00:05:25.200
In a funny kind of way.

00:05:25.200 --> 00:05:26.840
Like she was saying, figure it out on your
own.

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:27.840
Just walk it off.

00:05:27.840 --> 00:05:28.840
Just a flesh wound.

00:05:28.840 --> 00:05:32.430
Kira’s mom is also hundreds of years old
which the show hasn’t mentioned since 3B

00:05:32.430 --> 00:05:35.180
so I feel like it’s authentic for her to
be so detached.

00:05:35.180 --> 00:05:38.020
She’s literally seen everything a person
can do.

00:05:38.020 --> 00:05:44.060
Nothing surprises her, unless it’s demon
stiles breaking her last fox tail.

00:05:44.060 --> 00:05:47.410
3 - Kira Gets Her First Foxtail

00:05:47.410 --> 00:05:49.920
This was the other side of that.

00:05:49.920 --> 00:05:53.020
Everybody in the episode wins an award for
making it through another challenge.

00:05:53.020 --> 00:05:56.310
Kira’s reward is her first fox tail.

00:05:56.310 --> 00:06:00.160
As she gets more powerful season to season,
she’ll accumulate them until she gets all

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:01.160
9.

00:06:01.160 --> 00:06:03.840
As far as I know in the mythology, 9 is the
most they can have.

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:09.240
I’d really like to see some bonus content
either webisodes or something else where Kira’s

00:06:09.240 --> 00:06:12.440
mother tells her the stories of how she got
all 9 of her fox tails.

00:06:12.440 --> 00:06:16.500
They’re all gone right now, but if Kira
had to almost die and evolve to get the first

00:06:16.500 --> 00:06:17.500
one.

00:06:17.500 --> 00:06:19.550
Imagine what she’s going to have to do to
get the other 8…

00:06:19.550 --> 00:06:23.110
That also reminds you what a badass her mother
is.

00:06:23.110 --> 00:06:26.620
2 - Peter Was the Benefactor

00:06:26.620 --> 00:06:29.910
Not really a surprise, I think after the last
episode it was all but confirmed he was trying

00:06:29.910 --> 00:06:30.910
to get his alpha power back via scott.

00:06:30.910 --> 00:06:32.630
And as expected, he totally went down hard.

00:06:32.630 --> 00:06:37.730
They said they specifically made Ian Bohen’s
wolf makeup to look like Ducaelion’s just

00:06:37.730 --> 00:06:41.560
to call back to season 3A and Scott’s struggle
to become the true alpha.

00:06:41.560 --> 00:06:46.190
I love that they let Peter be the grand shakespeare
villain again.

00:06:46.190 --> 00:06:49.199
It was fun to see him play normal in the first
few episodes too.

00:06:49.199 --> 00:06:53.491
I feel like he and Derek have that Loki Thor
relationship that will be interesting to see

00:06:53.491 --> 00:06:54.491
in season 5.

00:06:54.491 --> 00:07:03.530
I’m pretty sure we’ll see a whole lot
of people coming to visit Peter.

00:07:03.530 --> 00:07:06.980
Especially Malia, trying to learn more about
the Desert Wolf.

00:07:06.980 --> 00:07:12.970
Because of her, Peter still has something
that the pack needs, or that Malia needs and

00:07:12.970 --> 00:07:14.540
by default the pack.

00:07:14.540 --> 00:07:16.970
So he’s not going away anytime soon.

00:07:16.970 --> 00:07:20.190
The Valack Peter Ship will be strong next
year too.

00:07:20.190 --> 00:07:22.910
Big Question: In their little prison situation.

00:07:22.910 --> 00:07:25.250
Is Peter the wife?

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:30.570
I think is, which is a nice way to laugh about
him given all the terrible shit he pulled

00:07:30.570 --> 00:07:31.570
this year.

00:07:31.570 --> 00:07:35.889
And my Number 1 WTF Moment - Scott Evolves
Into The Black Wolf

00:07:35.889 --> 00:07:39.720
Jeff Davis explained that they knew this is
where derek would end up before they ever

00:07:39.720 --> 00:07:41.570
started writing season 4.

00:07:41.570 --> 00:07:45.199
Because Derek’s journey isn’t about being
the alpha they had to evolve his character

00:07:45.199 --> 00:07:46.700
in a different way.

00:07:46.700 --> 00:07:51.390
For all intents and purposes, he’s just
become the perfect form of what a werewolf

00:07:51.390 --> 00:07:53.190
can become.

00:07:53.190 --> 00:07:57.520
Being able to shift completely into wolf form
is the something only a true master can pull

00:07:57.520 --> 00:07:58.520
off.

00:07:58.520 --> 00:08:03.900
So he’s just like super Zen Obi Wan Kenobi
wolf now.

00:08:03.900 --> 00:08:09.860
I predicted that he’d get his powers back,
but I was totally surprised by the way they

00:08:09.860 --> 00:08:11.060
explained it.

00:08:11.060 --> 00:08:14.720
And as cool as Derek joining the sheriff’s
department would have been, clearly they have

00:08:14.720 --> 00:08:16.710
something else planned for him next year.

00:08:16.710 --> 00:08:17.710
But now it’s your turn.

00:08:17.710 --> 00:08:23.540
Let me know, were you happy with what they
did to Derek and do you think the Desert Wolf

00:08:23.540 --> 00:08:25.430
is Kate or a new character?

00:08:25.430 --> 00:08:30.590
Here’s a few general thoughts on the season:

00:08:30.590 --> 00:08:36.200
Favorite Moments from the season - Derek Evolving,
Scott showing his true alpha form, Kira on

00:08:36.200 --> 00:08:48.431
the lacrosse team, Liam joining the pack and
Malia and Stiles, Malia was probably my favorite

00:08:48.431 --> 00:08:53.390
new pack member, but technically she wasn’t
new.

00:08:53.390 --> 00:08:56.190
My Most anticipated new pack member is Parrish.

00:08:56.190 --> 00:08:57.190
I can’t wait to see him learn about who
he is.

00:08:57.190 --> 00:08:59.180
My current best theory is phoenix.

00:08:59.180 --> 00:09:03.790
I’m a little disappointed there’s no 4B,
but really the story will still pick up the

00:09:03.790 --> 00:09:06.170
same place it would have had things been different.

00:09:06.170 --> 00:09:09.030
So I don’t think we’re missing any potential
stories.

00:09:09.030 --> 00:09:12.779
There are a lot of rumors Season 5 might be
their last, but I think it’s too soon to

00:09:12.779 --> 00:09:13.779
tell.

00:09:13.779 --> 00:09:20.680
Overall the finale was a nice conclusion to
the benefactor arc, I gave it a solid B plus

00:09:20.680 --> 00:09:23.510
for evolving all of the characters.

00:09:23.510 --> 00:09:24.760
Derek was the only one to say it out loud.

00:09:24.760 --> 00:09:26.940
But all of the characters evolved over the
course of the season.

00:09:26.940 --> 00:09:33.210
Malia is evolving into a human, Scott into
a true alpha, Lydia into a fully actualized

00:09:33.210 --> 00:09:34.210
banshee.

00:09:34.210 --> 00:09:35.210
Parrish into a phoenix.

00:09:35.210 --> 00:09:37.700
I’ll just keep saying phoenix until I think
of something better.

00:09:37.700 --> 00:09:44.750
If there’s anything I thought could have
been better it was just explaining a lot of

00:09:44.750 --> 00:09:47.370
the magical aspects.

00:09:47.370 --> 00:09:51.040
If any of you guys watch Legend of Korra,
that’s a show that explains it’s special

00:09:51.040 --> 00:09:52.930
abilities in great detail.

00:09:52.930 --> 00:09:56.960
Part of the reason I make videos is to learn
more, so please more explainers about the

00:09:56.960 --> 00:09:58.390
mechanics of the bestiary.

00:09:58.390 --> 00:10:01.850
If any of you are supernatural fans, that’s
another show that takes it’s literature

00:10:01.850 --> 00:10:04.950
really seriously a la Men of Letters.

00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:07.959
But overall, great end to a much more human
oriented season.

00:10:07.959 --> 00:10:12.610
I really liked this season more than 3B just
because the let the pack act more like teenagers

00:10:12.610 --> 00:10:13.899
and less like demon hunters.

00:10:13.899 --> 00:10:18.810
It’s a lot easier for me to relate my own
experience to them when they face family problems,

00:10:18.810 --> 00:10:21.130
girlfriend problems, high school problems.

00:10:21.130 --> 00:10:22.730
Like Math.

00:10:22.730 --> 00:10:25.440
Like I said, I’ll be posting my season 5
predictions tomorrow.

00:10:25.440 --> 00:10:27.140
Be sure to subscribe to get that.

00:10:27.140 --> 00:10:30.880
Since Teen Wolf is gone for a while, here’s
a few shows I want you guys to check out.

00:10:30.880 --> 00:10:33.430
Hint, Hint I’ll be doing videos for all
of them.

00:10:33.430 --> 00:10:38.010
The new Monday Night Shows are Gotham on FOX,
that starts at the end of the month.

00:10:38.010 --> 00:10:40.690
And Star Wars Rebels, that doesn’t start
till october.

00:10:40.690 --> 00:10:43.630
But I’ll be doing bonus videos starting
next week.

00:10:43.630 --> 00:10:49.200
Then The Flash with Grant Gustin is coming
on Tuesdays in about 4 weeks on the CW.

00:10:49.200 --> 00:10:52.000
Then Supernatural and Agents of SHIELD season
2.

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:53.060
All awesome shows.

00:10:53.060 --> 00:10:54.920
SHIELD is on ABC.

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:58.339
Arrow is my Wednesday show, if you’re not
watching it you should start right now.

00:10:58.339 --> 00:11:00.910
They’re basically doing justice league on
tv.

00:11:00.910 --> 00:11:02.260
It’s bad ass.

00:11:02.260 --> 00:11:07.660
And Friday Constantine, the other DC Comics
TV Show is coming in October too.

00:11:07.660 --> 00:11:13.710
I’m working on a fall schedule for all the
videos I’ll be doing, so look out for that

00:11:13.710 --> 00:11:14.710
this week.

00:11:14.710 --> 00:11:18.410
But feel free to suggest anything you think
I should check out.

